# Plutopus Shared Schemas

This package contains shared Pydantic schemas and models for the Plutopus platform, allowing consistent request and response patterns across all Python microservices.

## Schemas
- `HealthResponse`: Standard structure for health check endpoints.
- `ApiResponse`: Generic wrapper for successful and unsuccessful API responses.
- `ErrorResponse`: Structured formatting for error messaging.
